WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.167 --> 00:00:02.569
-Good evening, everybody,
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:04.003
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:06.339
And now, if you don't mind,
we are gonna get to the news.

00:00:06.339 --> 00:00:09.241
Former Vice President Mike Pence
announced on Saturday

00:00:09.241 --> 00:00:11.778
that he is ending
his presidential campaign,

00:00:11.778 --> 00:00:14.347
and said, "This is not my time,"

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:17.784
but only because his time
is the 1950s.

00:00:17.784 --> 00:00:19.085
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:21.554
President Biden today
signed an executive order

00:00:21.554 --> 00:00:24.257
regulating artificial
intelligence technology.

00:00:24.257 --> 00:00:27.960
It's so stringent that he now
has to play himself

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:30.430
in Disney's Hall of Presidents.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:34.366
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.366 --> 00:00:37.203
While speaking at
a campaign event yesterday

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:39.238
in Sioux City, Iowa,
former President Trump

00:00:39.238 --> 00:00:42.174
mistakenly referred
to the South Dakota city

00:00:42.174 --> 00:00:44.076
of Sioux Falls.
Well, that's it.

00:00:44.076 --> 00:00:47.313
He's got to be done now, right?
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:49.815
I mean, 91 felony charges
is one thing,

00:00:49.815 --> 00:00:52.785
but you can't mix up
the Sioux.

00:00:52.785 --> 00:00:56.656
According to a new survey,
75% of Americans believe

00:00:56.656 --> 00:00:59.793
that democracy is at risk in
the 2024 presidential election.

00:00:59.793 --> 00:01:03.563
And the other 25% is enough
to win the Electoral College.

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:04.831
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.831 --> 00:01:07.166
Vice President Kamala Harris
appeared last night

00:01:07.166 --> 00:01:09.302
on "60 minutes,"
which means that rescuers

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:12.305
were finally able
to call off the search.

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:15.774
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.774 --> 00:01:20.146
Vice President Kamala Harris
said in a new interview

00:01:20.146 --> 00:01:22.548
that her relationship
with President Biden is similar

00:01:22.548 --> 00:01:25.384
to the one Biden had with
former President Barack Obama.

00:01:25.384 --> 00:01:27.053
Oh, so,
you think you're friends,

00:01:27.053 --> 00:01:29.122
and he thinks you're co-workers?

00:01:29.122 --> 00:01:32.258
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.258 --> 00:01:34.293
Minnesota Congressman
Dean Phillips

00:01:34.293 --> 00:01:35.961
announced on Friday
that he is launching

00:01:35.961 --> 00:01:37.830
a primary challenge
to President Biden.

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:40.633
Now, if you're familiar
with Dean Phillips,

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:44.003
then thank you for watching,
Mrs. Phillips.

00:01:44.003 --> 00:01:46.005
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.005 --> 00:01:48.541
Today was Ivanka Trump's
42nd birthday,

00:01:48.541 --> 00:01:49.842
and I just think it's nice

00:01:49.842 --> 00:01:52.178
she gets to spend it
with family.

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:54.179
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.179 --> 00:01:58.117
According to a new estimate
from "Forbes" magazine,

00:01:58.117 --> 00:02:00.019
Taylor Swift
is now a billionaire,

00:02:00.019 --> 00:02:03.623
which means that someone has
a difficult decision to make.

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:06.959
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.959 --> 00:02:10.096
"On one hand,
I want to see it.

00:02:10.096 --> 00:02:13.299
On the other hand, billionaires
have too much money."

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:17.370
[ Laughter ]

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:18.971
-New York Congressman
George Santos

00:02:18.971 --> 00:02:21.474
pleaded not guilty last week
to additional charges

00:02:21.474 --> 00:02:24.744
and then winked so hard
it gave him a smoky eye.

00:02:24.744 --> 00:02:26.545
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.545 --> 00:02:29.482
A 92-year-old man from Spain
recently completed

00:02:29.482 --> 00:02:32.117
a 24-mile hike
of the Grand Canyon.

00:02:32.117 --> 00:02:35.355
Said the man, "Last time
I was here, this was all flat."

00:02:35.355 --> 00:02:37.457
[ Laughter ]

00:02:37.457 --> 00:02:39.225
And finally,
the World Cheese Awards

00:02:39.225 --> 00:02:40.460
were held last week,

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:43.228
and a blue cheese from Norway
won first place.

00:02:43.228 --> 00:02:45.431
And it was all going great
until...

00:02:45.431 --> 00:02:47.367
-I'm really happy for you.
I'mma let you finish.

00:02:47.367 --> 00:02:49.635
[ Laughter ]
-Kanye.

00:02:49.635 --> 00:02:52.505
Kanye, no.

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:54.106
That was the monologue,
everybody.

00:02:54.106 --> 00:02:55.608
We're off and running.

